ompanied by Warm Paratha Bread, Creamy Indian Vegetable Curry, Turned Potatoes, and a Refreshing Mint Yogurt Sauce', 120000, 'IDR', 0), ('Asian Fusion Delight', 'Balinese Crispy Duck', 'Experience Authentic Ubud-Style Crispy Fried Duck with Fragrant Organic Steamed Rice, Sautéed Water Spinach in Tangy Tomato Chili Sauce, accompanied with Crunchy Crackers and a Selection of Flavorful Balinese Sambals', 170000, 'IDR', 1), ('Asian Fusion Delight', 'Chicken Teriyaki', 'Grilled Chicken, Paired Perfectly with Fragrant Steamed Rice, Refreshing Coleslaw, and Our Signature Homemade Teriyaki Sauce', 120000, 'IDR', 2), ('Asian Fusion Delight', 'Nasi Campur Ubud', 'Embark on a Culinary Adventure with Our Balinese Style Rijsttafel, Featuring Tender Shredded Chicken, Crispy Breaded Shrimp, Flavorful Sate Lilit, Spicy Boiled Egg Balado, Savory Bean Cake, Crunchy Peanut, and Vibrant Mixed Vegetables with Grated Coconut. Complemented Perfectly with Zesty Sambal Matah, Served Alongside Fragrant Steamed Rice and Crunchy Prawn Crackers', 125000, 'IDR', 3), ('Main Stir Fry', 'Braised Tofu and Vegetarian Stir-Fry Delight', 'Braised Tofu, Stir-Fried Together with Baby Corn, Bell Pepper, Carrots, and Snow Peas with a Tantalizing Black Pepper Sauce, Served with Fragrant Steamed Rice', 85000, 'IDR', 0), ('Main Stir Fry', 'Char Kway Teow with Chicken Katsu', 'Stir-Fried Kway Teow Noodles accompanied by Sliced Fried Eggs, a Tantalizing Assortment of Vegetables, and a Crispy Fried Chicken Breast, Creating a Harmonious Blend of Textures and Tastes', 105000, 'IDR', 1), ('Main Stir Fry', 'Yonne Café Nasi Goreng', 'Savor the Essence of Indonesia with Our Traditional Fried Rice, Featuring a Symphony of Flavors Including Tender Fried Chicken, Succulent Chicken Satay, Fried Egg, Crispy Tempura Prawn, Accompanied by Crunchy Prawn Crackers and a Medley of Tantalizing Condiments', 105000, 'IDR', 2), ('Main Stir Fry', 'Yonne Café Mie Goreng', 'Stir-fried Egg Noodles complemented by Savory Fried Chicken, Delectable Satay Lilit, a Fluffy Shredded Omelette, Crispy Tempura Prawns, Served with Prawn Crackers and an Array of Condiments', 105000, 'IDR', 3), ('Main Stir Fry', 'Beef Broccoli', 'Succulent Oyster Glazed Beef and Broccoli, Stir-Fried to Perfection, Served with Steamed Rice', 115000, 'IDR', 4), ('Sizzling From The Grill', 'Grilled Prime Tenderloin Steak', 'Succulent 160 Grams of Tenderloin Steak, Expertly Grilled to Perfection. Accompanied by a Medley of Sauteed Vegetables and Your Choice of Sauces and Side Dish', 210000, 'IDR', 0), ('Sizzling From The Grill', 'Grilled Chicken Parmigiana', 'Tender chicken breast, perfectly grilled to perfection, layered with house-made tomato sauce and bubbling mozzarella cheese. Served with crispy fries and a vibrant mixed salad.', 125000, 'IDR', 1), ('Sizzling From The Grill', 'Indonesian Satay SenSation', 'An Authentic Taste of Indonesia! Savour 6 Tender and Aromatic Sticks of Grilled Chicken Satay, Served with a Side of Fragrant Steamed Rice. Enjoy It with a Rich and Velvety Peanut Sauce for Dipping, and a Side of Crispy Crackers', 110000, 'IDR', 2), ('Sizzling From The Grill', 'Grilled Dory Fish with BBQ Glaze', 'Complemented with Sauteed Mixed Vegetables, Golden Fried Breaded Onion Rings, and Luscious Mashed Potatoes', 148000, 'IDR', 3), ('Sandwiches & Burgers', 'SenS Burger', 'Indulge in the Ultimate Burger Experience with Our Homemade 120 Grams Beef Patty on a Sesame Bun, Cheese, Beef Bacon, Onions, Egg, and Duo of Tomato Ketchup and Mayonnaise, Served with Crispy French Fries', 150000, 'IDR', 0), ('Sandwiches & Burgers', 'Chicken Burger', 'Savor the Crispy Goodness of Breaded Chicken Fillet, Topped with Cheese, Fresh Vegetables, and Tomato Ketchup in Soft Burger Bun. Accompanied by French Fries and Tangy Teriyaki Sauce', 125000, 'IDR', 1), ('Sandwiches & Burgers', 'Green Burger', 'A Treat for Vegans, our Green Burger features a Wholesome Blend of Zucchini, Mushroom, Grated Carrots, Chickpea, and Creamy Mashed Potato, drizzled with Tofu Mayonnaise. Served with crispy French Fries', 115000, 'IDR', 2), ('Sandwiches & Burgers', 'SenS Club Sandwich', 'Treat Yourself to Layers of Oven-Roasted Chicken, Crispy Beef Bacon, Crunchy Lettuce, Juicy Tomatoes, and a Dollop of Creamy Mayonnaise, All Sandwiched Between Toasted Brown Bread and Accompanied with Crispy French Fries', 125000, 'IDR', 3), ('Sandwiches & Burgers', 'Tuna Croissant Sandwich', 'Savor The Delightful Blend of Tuna Mayo, Tomato Ketchup, and Crisp Vegetables Nestled in a Flaky Croissant, Served with Golden French Fries', 125000, 'IDR', 4), ('Sandwiches & Burgers', 'Vegetarian Bagel Sandwich', 'Delight in a Medley of Flavours with Our Vegetarian Delight, Featuring Cream Cheese, Tofu, Fresh Veggies, and Tangy Tomato Ketchup on a Wholesome Bagel Bread', 115000, 'IDR', 5), ('Signature Dish', 'Balinese Set Menu', 'Traditional Duck in Balinese Spices served with Steamed Rice, accompanied by Authentic Balinese Chicken Soup, Prawns, Egg Balado, Balinese Lawar, Sate Lilit, Shredded Chicken, Peanuts, Balinese Sambal Matah, and Crackers.', 190000, 'IDR', 0), ('Chinese Menu', 'Duck Spring Roll', 'Crispy Golden Spring Rolls filled with Tender Duck Meat and Fragrant Vegetables, served with a Light Dipping Sauce.', 85000, 'IDR', 0), ('Chinese Menu', 'Delectable Dim Sum and Wontons', 'A Selection of Steamed and Fried Dim Sum, Including Delicate Wontons filled with Seasoned Meat and Vegetables.', 90000, 'IDR', 1), ('Chinese Menu', 'Wonton Noodle Soup', 'A Nourishing Soup with Handmade Chicken-Filled Wontons, Fresh Bok Choy, Carrot Slices, and Spring Onions, All Simmered in a Light, Aromatic Chicken Broth.', 85000, 'IDR', 2), ('Chinese Menu', 'Egg Drop Soup', 'Light and Comforting Chicken Broth with Shiitake Mushrooms, Minced Chicken, Fresh Scallions, and Silky Egg Ribbons.', 75000, 'IDR', 3), ('Chinese Menu', 'Sweet and Sour Fish', 'Crispy Fish Fillet Tossed in a Vibrant Sweet and Tangy Sauce and Vegetables, served with Steamed Rice', 125000, 